  "gaps": [
    "The capture contains parts of three programs (B.S. Human Resource Management without its heading, B.S. Information Systems and Cyber Security, and a truncated B.S. Information Technology); this ledger covers B.S. Information Systems and Cyber Security, the only one captured in full. Confirm this is the intended program.",
    "Concentration is optional. Open electives are 30–42 credits, and only 30 are required if a 12-credit concentration is completed. The 12-credit block is either a concentration (General, General Accelerated Path, or Homeland Security: HLS 3301, HLS 3302, HLS 3303, HLS 3306) or 12 additional open elective credits.",
